# NOTE: held-out fixtures are opted in per pack, by EXPLICIT block, on purpose.
# Do NOT add a catch-all like `evals/benchmarks/*/cases.jsonl` — the repo also
# publishes public corpora (local_public_v1/v2/v3), and a catch-all would
# silently un-track a future public pack. Every new held-out pack gets its own
# four-line block above, matching the finance precedent.

# Local harness state (launch configs, agent worktrees) — machine-specific.
.claude/
